# The build context is the repo root, but the image only needs these paths
# (see image/Dockerfile COPY lines). Without this file docker uploads
# hub/workspaces (47 GB of user data) and adapter/node_modules (1.2 GB) on
# every build. Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include what is copied.
*

!adapter/package.json
!adapter/package-lock.json
!adapter/dist/

!mcp-memory/package.json
!mcp-memory/package-lock.json
!mcp-memory/dist/

!image/kernel-bridge.py
!image/memory-builder.py
!image/entrypoint.sh
